  "text_pages": [
    "Mobility for students | Univerzita Pardubice\nSkip to main content\nMobility for students\nWant to get the most out of your exchange experience? Study at the University of Pardubice.\nStudy in the heart of Europe\nMeet over 500 other international students\nChoose courses from any of our 7 faculties\nTake advantage of guaranteed\naccommodation\nright on campus\nFollow the ESN Pardubice\nfacebook\nand\ninstagram\nfor leisure time activities\nGet support from your own dedicated buddy\nGet in touch with our friendly and helpful staff\nFollow these\nsteps\nMartina Votoupalová\nCEEPUS, Erasmus+ Incoming Mobility\nRectorate and University Units\nmartina.votoupalova@upce.cz\n466 036 445\nMgr. Věra Albrechtová\nErasmus Institutional Coordinator\nRectorate and University Units\nvera.albrechtova@upce.cz\n466 036 350\nWhat students shared about their stay in Pardubice?\n\"Helpful and nice staff in Faculty of Health Studies, hospital, and also in EMS. 100% support with everything and especially during difficult covid19-pandemic.\"\nVuorinen Ville\nErasmus student at the Faculty of Health Studies\n\"This experience allowed me to make many international friends and complete my studies in a different, but welcoming environment.\"\nArthur Demaeght\nErasmus student at Faculty of Transportation Engineering\nUniversity of Pardubice\nMap\nContacts\n​\nContacts\nFaculties and Central Services and Facilites\nPanoramic view\nExchange/Erasmus+\nInternational students\nMagazine MY UPCE\nWebsite feedback\nServices\nAccommodation\nLibrary\nDepartment of Physical Education and Sports\nNostrification\nE-shop\nThe Centre for Technology  and Knowledge Transfer\nLanguage Centre\nGuidebook for Internationals\nEuropean University Alliance\n© 2023\nUniversity of Pardubice\n,\nStudentská 95\n,\n532 10\nPardubice 2\nPhone:\n+420 466 036 111, 466 036 112, 466 036 113\nWebmaster\n,\nRSS\nData box ID:\nf5vj9hu\nAccessibility Statement\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0"
  ],
